OL,3,ATwo killed in 'domestic violence
OL,4,Aincident' at school near Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been killed in a
OL,7,F"domestic violence incident" at a
OL,8,Fschool in the town of Gosen-Neu Zittau
OL,9,Fnear the German capital Berlin, local
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FBrandenburg state police said they
OL,13,Farrested a 19-year-old German man, who
OL,14,Fis "considered a prime suspect". They
OL,15,Fsaid it was not a "mass shooting",
OL,16,Fwithout specifying what weapon was
OL,17,Fused.
OL,19,FIt is not yet known if the suspect was
OL,20,Fa student at the private Docemus
OL,21,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
