OL,3,ATwo killed in 'domestic violence
OL,4,Aincident' at school near Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the dead was an 18-year-old
OL,7,Fsecondary school female student and the
OL,8,Fother victim was a 30-year-old man who
OL,9,Fdied when he tried to intervene, local
OL,10,Fmedia reported.
